#: ../../ml/gaussian_process_regression.rst:2
msgid "ガウス過程回帰"
msgstr "Gaussian Process Regression"

#: ../../ml/gaussian_process_regression.rst:4
msgid ""
"線形回帰を出発点に、パラメータの点推定、事後分布を使った予測、ガウス過程回帰へ進みます。確率分布や行列の公式は :doc:`付録 "
"<appendix/index>` にまとめています。"
msgstr ""
"Starting with linear regression, we move from point estimation of the "
"parameters to prediction using the posterior distribution and then to "
"Gaussian process regression. For probability distributions and matrix "
"formulas, see the :doc:`appendix <appendix/index>`."

